    "turn_text": "food. But you know, and I know this is not a conversation about the Rhodes scholarship, but you know, because of what we were talking about before, because it's this sort of mark of prestige. Somebody said something I think, in which there is a lot of wisdom, that is that Rhodes scholars are a group of, I think the individual might have said men back when it was men only, but Rhodes scholars are a group of men with fantastic futures behind them. There's a little bit of it. There's a heavy expectation. You're going to be president of the United States or an admiral or a CEO of a Fortune 100 company. And again, that's not the point of this conversation, but that definitely is a weight of expectation that lives on those shoulders.",
