    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74126.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 67,
    "turn_text": "So actually I'd love to touch on the storming of the Capitol. We're now recording this at the end of January so it's still obviously very relevant and very fresh in our minds. Jim were you anywhere near the Capitol when it happened?",
