    "turn_text": "So, so I'm just, I mean, I could talk to you for hours about all this because I just find it so unbelievably fascinating. But I am aware of the time, but I would like to ask you one more question on this politics in the next few months. So, you know, you've got, I'm reading in the newspapers, you've got issues that There's no COVID a plan, you've got civil unrest going on in the States. What's your greatest hopes for the next few months now that Biden and Harris are in?",
