      },
      {
        "text": "This culture involves a highly welcoming environment for interpersonal interaction.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Some elderly attendees were WWII veterans who participated in social gatherings during the 1980s.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The UK has a more rigidly stratified social structure and more reserved social etiquette compared to North America.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "In the past, individuals who had lived for 70 years or more showed up at events despite having no obligation to interact with younger people like me.",
